CAMPUS COIN
Student Income & Expense Management System
Campus Coin is a web-based Student Income & Expense Management System developed using PHP, MySQL, HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Bootstrap. It allows students to manage income, expenses, transactions, balance and financial reports. The system also includes an administrator-controlled approval process for newly registered users.
