5. Project Installation
Step 1 — Copy Project
Copy the complete Campus Coin project folder into:
```text
C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\
```
Example:
```text
C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\campus\_coin\\
```
Step 2 — Start XAMPP
Open XAMPP Control Panel and start:
```text
Apache
MySQL
```
Step 3 — Open phpMyAdmin
```text
http://localhost/phpmyadmin
```
Step 4 — Create Database
Create a MySQL database named:
```text
campus\_coin
```
Step 5 — Import Database
Open the `campus\_coin` database in phpMyAdmin.
Select Import.
Choose the project SQL file `campus\_coin.sql`.
Click Go.
Wait until the import completes successfully.
Step 6 — Check Database Configuration
Open the project's database configuration file and make sure the settings match your local XAMPP/MySQL setup.
Typical configuration:
```php
$host = "localhost";
$user = "root";
$password = "";
$database = "campus\_coin";
```
If your MySQL password is different, use your actual password.
Step 7 — Run Campus Coin
```text
http://localhost/campus\_coin/
```
