14. Security / Access Control
Newly registered accounts start as Pending.
Pending users cannot access protected user pages.
Admin approval changes the account to Approved/Active.
Rejected/inactive accounts cannot access the system.
Protected pages require the appropriate authenticated session.
User and administrator access are separated.
