15. Troubleshooting
Apache is not starting
Check whether another application is using port 80/443.
Close conflicting services.
Restart XAMPP as administrator if required.
MySQL is not starting
Check whether another MySQL/MariaDB service is already running.
Stop the conflicting service and restart MySQL from XAMPP.
Database connection error
Check:
```text
Host: localhost
Username: root
Password: your local MySQL password
Database: campus\_coin
```
Also confirm that the SQL database was imported successfully.
404 / Project Not Found
Make sure the project is inside:
```text
C:\\xampp\\htdocs\\
```
Then verify the URL matches the actual folder name.
Example:
```text
http://localhost/campus\_coin/
```
User cannot log in
Check:
Email is correct.
Password is correct.
The account exists in the database.
The account status is Approved/Active.
The user is not still Pending or Rejected.
